586				<h2 id="features">Features</h2>
587				<ul>
588					<li>Semantic HTML structure with proper landmarks</li>
589					<li>Keyboard accessible navigation and focus management</li>
590					<li>Dark mode support with custom color schemes</li>
591					<li>Responsive typography using modern CSS</li>
592					<li>Print-friendly styles for better readability</li>
593					<li>WCAG AA contrast compliance in all color modes</li>
594				</ul>
595			</section>
